They're too emotional.

827
00:53:02,679 --> 00:53:03,889
That's so pathetic.

828
00:53:04,431 --> 00:53:06,057
Look who's talking, nervous tweaker.

829
00:53:06,141 --> 00:53:07,141
Fuck you, bitch.

830
00:53:09,519 --> 00:53:11,396
<i>Attention, all players.</i>

831
00:53:11,479 --> 00:53:14,399
<i>Please wait patiently as our staff tidies up the game hall</i>

832
00:53:14,482 --> 00:53:16,693
<i>before the start of the next race.</i>

833
00:53:52,479 --> 00:53:53,480
Open it.

